.TH KEYSWITCH 1 "August 2026" "KeySwitch 0.5.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
keyswitch \- automatic keyboard layout correction for Ubuntu X11
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B keyswitch
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B KeySwitch
observes keyboard events in the current X11 session, detects words entered in
the wrong English or Russian layout, changes the XKB group and replaces the
mistyped word.
.PP
By default, KeySwitch also checks the current word after 1.5 seconds without
typing, before a separator is entered. Idle correction can be disabled
independently in the application settings.
.PP
Settings, exclusions, hotkeys, history and diagnostics are available from the
application window. Left-clicking the desktop indicator opens its native menu
with correction toggles, settings, history, exclusions, about and quit actions.
.PP
After a manual word conversion with Pause/Break, KeySwitch displays a focused
prompt above the input position. Enter immediately adds the conversion to the
local switching rules; Escape dismisses the offer. Local learning and its
fallback repeated-conversion threshold are configurable in the application.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-hidden
Start without presenting the main window.
.TP
.B \-\-diagnose
Probe the X11 RECORD, XTEST and XKB backend, print JSON and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the installed KeySwitch version and exit.
.TP
.BR \-h , " \-\-help"
Show command-line help and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/keyswitch/config.json
User settings.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/keyswitch/history.jsonl
Correction history, when enabled.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/keyswitch/learning.json
Explicitly learned conversions and rejected automatic corrections.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/keyswitch/dictionaries/
Optional per-user Hunspell dictionaries.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/keyswitch/keyswitch.log
Application log.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B DISPLAY
X11 display used for global input observation and correction.
.TP
.B XDG_SESSION_TYPE
Must identify an X11 session for the global backend.
.TP
.B KEYSWITCH_HUNSPELL_PATH
Optional colon-separated list of Hunspell dictionary directories.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR setxkbmap (1)
.SH BUGS
Report issues at https://github.com/olegius88/keyswitch/issues.
